#: 9118b1366ecb47ec9b4dcbc66d68b1c6
msgid "Never disable arming checks (ie :ref:`ARMING_SKIPCHK<ARMING_SKIPCHK>` not = \"0\", except for bench testing. Always resolve any prearm or arming failures BEFORE attempting to fly. Doing otherwise may result in the loss of the vehicle."
